<title>USA: National Bancorp Q1 shr $1.52 vs $1.33.</title>
<headline>National Bancorp Q1 shr $1.52 vs $1.33.</headline>
<dateline>ANCHORAGE 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.52		    $1.33</p>
<p> Net		 12,000		   10,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is National Bancorp of Alaska.</p>
<p>Deposits were $1.79 billion, compared to $1.70 billion as of March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Total loans were $1.47 billion, compared to $1.40 billion as of March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The bank's total assets as of March 31, 1997 were $2.60 billion, compared to $2.46 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>Total shareholders' equity was $380.8 million compared to $355.4 million a year ago.</p>
</text>
